##
## CachyOS-Surface integration config overrides
##
## Applied LAST in config merge chain (CachyOS base → Surface → these).
## These resolve conflicts specific to the CachyOS+Surface combination.
##

##
## Transparent Hugepages: 'madvise' mode is better for Surface devices
## CachyOS defaults to 'always' which can cause latency on tablets
##
CONFIG_TRANSPARENT_HUGEPAGE_MADVISE=y
# CONFIG_TRANSPARENT_HUGEPAGE_ALWAYS is not set

##
## Android binder: needed by IPTSD (surface touchscreen daemon)
## CachyOS may use different binder device names
##
CONFIG_ASHMEM=y
CONFIG_ANDROID=y
CONFIG_ANDROID_BINDER_IPC=y
CONFIG_ANDROID_BINDERFS=y
CONFIG_ANDROID_BINDER_DEVICES=""

##
## KSM: CachyOS enables this but it causes latency spikes on Surface
##
# CONFIG_KSM is not set

##
## HID generic as module: allows Surface HID driver to coexist properly
## CachyOS builds it built-in =y but surface patches add HID_SURFACE
## that needs to load after HID_GENERIC
##
CONFIG_HID_GENERIC=m